{"pages": {"1": [{"bbox": [46.0, 479.0, 728.0, 776.0], "text": "## Frontier-scale MoE serving at Modular"}, {"bbox": [820.0, 866.0, 950.0, 907.0], "text": "BRENDAN DUKE"}], "10": [{"bbox": [42.0, 256.0, 964.0, 444.0], "text": "## How to determine compute vs. communication bound? First assume perfect compute/comms overlap"}], "11": [{"bbox": [45.0, 258.0, 968.0, 560.0], "text": "How to determine compute vs. communication bound?\n\nFirst assume perfect compute/comms overlap\n\nThen look at the arithmetic intensity"}], "12": [{"bbox": [4.0, 16.0, 629.0, 149.0], "text": "## Arithmetic intensity"}, {"bbox": [37.0, 404.0, 963.0, 627.0], "text": "## Arithmetic Intensity = $\\frac{Computation FLOPs}{Communication Bytes}$"}], "13": [{"bbox": [5.0, 16.0, 629.0, 148.0], "text": "## Arithmetic intensity"}, {"bbox": [4.0, 316.0, 291.0, 399.0], "text": "$T_{\\mathrm{math}} > T_{\\mathrm{comms}}\\Leftrightarrow$"}, {"bbox": [296.0, 272.0, 632.0, 632.0], "text": "Computation FLOPs\n\nAccelerator FLOPs/s\n\nComputation FLOPs\n\nCommunication Bytes"}, {"bbox": [665.0, 272.0, 998.0, 346.0], "text": "Communication Bytes"}, {"bbox": [679.0, 359.0, 984.0, 438.0], "text": "Bandwidth Bytes/s"}, {"bbox": [677.0, 464.0, 998.0, 540.0], "text": "Accelerator FLOPs/s"}, {"bbox": [685.0, 553.0, 986.0, 629.0], "text": "Bandwidth Bytes/s"}, {"bbox": [231.0, 664.0, 624.0, 739.0], "text": "Intensity(Computation)"}, {"bbox": [635.0, 664.0, 990.0, 740.0], "text": "Intensity(Accelerator)"}], "14": [{"bbox": [4.0, 15.0, 398.0, 151.0], "text": "## Dot product"}, {"bbox": [12.0, 357.0, 1000.0, 616.0], "text": "## Intensity(dot product) = $\\frac{Total FLOPs}{Total Bytes}=?$"}, {"bbox": [52.0, 639.0, 266.0, 712.0], "text": "Bfloat16 dtype"}], "15": [{"bbox": [4.0, 16.0, 398.0, 150.0], "text": "## Dot product"}, {"bbox": [10.0, 402.0, 1000.0, 592.0], "text": "Intensity（dot product）= $\\frac{N+N-1}{2 N+2 N+2}=\\frac{2 N-1}{4 N+2}\\rightarrow \\frac{1}{2}$"}, {"bbox": [46.0, 772.0, 341.0, 857.0], "text": "N: vector length"}], "16": [{"bbox": [9.0, 16.0, 488.0, 141.0], "text": "## Roofline model"}, {"bbox": [112.0, 542.0, 304.0, 652.0], "text": "## FLOPs/s realized (log scale)"}], "17": [{"bbox": [8.0, 12.0, 550.0, 140.0], "text": "## Roofline model"}, {"bbox": [119.0, 546.0, 309.0, 655.0], "text": "## FLOPs/s realized (log scale)"}], "18": [{"bbox": [8.0, 13.0, 289.0, 256.0], "text": "## Matmul\n\nBfloat16 dtype"}, {"bbox": [0.0, 457.0, 999.0, 631.0], "text": "## Intensity(matmul) = $\\frac{2 B D F}{2 B D+2 D F+2 B F}=\\frac{B D F}{B D+D F+B F}$"}], "19": [{"bbox": [8.0, 12.0, 289.0, 256.0], "text": "## Matmul\n\nBfloat16 dtype"}, {"bbox": [119.0, 285.0, 860.0, 800.0], "text": "$$\n\\frac {B D F}{B D + D F + B F} \\approx \\frac {B D F}{D F} = B\n$$"}], "2": [{"bbox": [50.0, 96.0, 221.0, 190.0], "text": "## Agenda"}, {"bbox": [50.0, 243.0, 454.0, 858.0], "text": "1 Introduction\n\n2 Performance primer\n\n3 Mixture of experts\n\n4 Disaggregated inference\n\n5 Modular platform\n\n6 Q & A"}], "20": [{"bbox": [6.0, 1.0, 714.0, 76.0], "text": "## Qwen 235B-A22B gate up proj: [4096,3072]"}], "21": [{"bbox": [6.0, 12.0, 716.0, 166.0], "text": "## Mixture of experts"}, {"bbox": [141.0, 824.0, 858.0, 890.0], "text": "Expert 1 Expert 2 Expert 3 Expert 4 Expert 5 Expert 6"}], "22": [{"bbox": [6.0, 10.0, 715.0, 172.0], "text": "## Mixture of experts"}, {"bbox": [425.0, 400.0, 512.0, 452.0], "text": "Router"}, {"bbox": [688.0, 383.0, 889.0, 494.0], "text": "sigmoid(x @ W.T)\n\nW: [256, 7168]"}, {"bbox": [115.0, 842.0, 831.0, 908.0], "text": "Expert 1 Expert 2 Expert 3 Expert 4 Expert 5 Expert 6"}], "23": [{"bbox": [11.0, 24.0, 709.0, 149.0], "text": "## Dense transformers"}], "24": [{"bbox": [9.0, 16.0, 807.0, 149.0], "text": "## Dense transformers"}], "25": [{"bbox": [8.0, 10.0, 716.0, 165.0], "text": "## Mixture of experts"}], "26": [{"bbox": [7.0, 22.0, 864.0, 162.0], "text": "## Dense vs. sparse MoE"}, {"bbox": [70.0, 316.0, 442.0, 383.0], "text": "All MoEs are sparse!"}, {"bbox"